Cell["\<\
The above histograms are just a reproduction of that is shown in Camisassa \
https://arxiv.org/abs/2305.02110 Fig 8., from Jim\[EAcute]nez-Esteban et al. \
(2023).

A quick check for how many near Chandrasekhar white dwarfs in this sample :\
\>", "Text",
