Cell["\<\
We want to assemble a big enough number, say ~ 10,000 white dwarf binaries \
whose components are drawn from the mass distribution of DA white dwarfs in \
the complete sample.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.992643303416744*^9, 3.992643375561864*^9}, {
  3.993768342525516*^9, 3.993768354813345*^9}, {3.993768445901865*^9, 
