Cell["\<\
As expected, the draws follow the \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]DAcut\
\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] distribution which we based the sampling on.

Now we calculate the sum of the pairs of drawn masses :\
\>", "Text",
