Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["c. The binary sample from Jewett", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993767325788621*^9, 3.993767343316125*^9}, {
  3.993769069863875*^9, 
  3.993769070696703*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"ca5b41d4-9d8c-4521-b5dc-\
e3aac7d0b60e"],

Cell["\<\
We want to compare this (naive?) prediction of a mass distribution to the \
mass distribution of the binary merger candidates . This could tell us about \
the rate of sub-Chandrasekar mergers which leave no remnant (e.g. in a Type \
Ia), i.e about a \[OpenCurlyDoubleQuote]disappeared\[CloseCurlyDoubleQuote] \
population of CO+CO mergers.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993769278334405*^9, 
  3.993769423903243*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"aa17a613-d5b8-405b-bbab-\
6602e551c504"],

Cell["\<\
(Table here \
https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/\
