Chancery\",FontWeight->\"Regular\",FontSlant->\"Italic\"], \"chirp\"]\) (\!\(\
\*SubscriptBox[\(M\), \(\(\\\ \)\(\[Sun]\)\(\\\ \)\)]\))\>\"", "]"}], ",", 
