Cell["\<\
In summary, taking the Ia rate as the merger rate predicts ~10, while our \
merger rate predicts ~1.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993771934518919*^9, 
  3.9937719726492*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"72a272b8-3252-4ae1-b98f-635b2e1a3455"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["\<\
Calculating a number distribution of CO+CO binaries (i.e. the progenitors of \
Ultra-massive WD merger products) in the 100 pc sample\
\>", "Subsection",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993770664327108*^9, 3.9937706765652847`*^9}, {
  3.993770761679531*^9, 
  3.9937708061754293`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7dd20b6b-bec2-4cf7-bd9a-\
df46a417d3bd"],

Cell["\<\
We just calculated the total number via definite integral, but given a merger \
rate we can also predict the mass distribution . This is really only relevant \
if there are larger volume limited samples in the future, but we present it \
anyway .\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993772166865205*^9, 
  3.993772233647593*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2fd06c7b-2633-41b7-8d9b-\
6dd3c449b206"],

Cell["\<\
For the number distribution with frequency N(f), we take the integral of the \
merger rate (Eq . 5 in McNeill and Seto 2022)\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993772335646488*^9, 
  3.993772386779611*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"2b5b903f-d506-411d-9791-\
cfc8c0661a28"],

Cell["\<\
For taking the Ia rate, the number distribution as a function of mHz will be \
given by the integral\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.993773083488192*^9, 
  3.993773110431353*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"7d4097fb-5e30-4b0e-9849-\
9244c0da8714"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{
  FractionBox["RMWhigh", 
   RowBox[{"\[Pi]", " ", 
    SuperscriptBox["10", "7"]}]], "vobs", " ", 
  RowBox[{"Integrate", "[", 
   RowBox[{
    SuperscriptBox[
     RowBox[{"dfdt", "[", 
      RowBox[{
       RowBox[{"0.001", "fGW"}], ",", "0.5"}], "]"}], 
     RowBox[{"-", "1"}]], ",", "fGW"}], "]"}], "0.001"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
  "In[132]:=",ExpressionUUID->"ba2dcab5-c5c1-48f5-b37c-a4fe3a7956ca"],

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"-", 
  FractionBox["0.07709566112697352`", 
   SuperscriptBox["fGW", 
    RowBox[{"8", "/", "3"}]]]}]], "Output",
 CellChangeTimes->{3.993773243533431*^9},
 CellLabel->
  "Out[132]=",ExpressionUUID->"d1401b4d-dd23-4c65-b6ab-37463e749899"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
 RowBox[{"NIa", "[", 
  FractionBox["2", 
   RowBox[{"z", " ", "0.001", " ", "60", " ", "60"}]], "]"}]], "Input",
 CellLabel->
